  "solution": "$150$ hours is $1.5$ half-lives:\n$$\\frac{A}{A_0} = \\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^{150/100} = \\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^{3/2} = \\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{2}}$$",
